hypertext
{
<tab><cl=F0F010>THE BOOK OF MAPS<cl=A2A2A2><br><br>
<tab>The card book allows you to store all the cards your character has. To view a specific map, double-click on its name with the left mouse button.<br>
<tab>When you call the map with the "M" key (by default), a map corresponding to the current location of your character appears on the screen. If there are several such cards, a card appears that is located in the card book above the others.<br>
}